      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A repeat of yesterday's EU servers. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/timeout-2\n\nI would see an user from another EU country get disconnected, and I would get disconnected some 9 seconds later very specifically in that order. This occurred 3-4 times in an EU realtime server. NA users seem to be unaffected. During those 9 seconds, I would still be connected, hear voices and see IK movements of other users.\n\nLook specifically for \"`OnPlayerLeft Zoralback`\" in the logs. (x3)\n\n```\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerLeftRoom\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerLeft Zoralback (usr_5b1431fe-2fc0-4e1b-af43-501ed7e7e2a1)\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  Updating player location statistics...\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  Updating Rooms\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  No Rooms\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  Removed player Zoralback\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:08 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Destroying Zoralback\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Error      -  SendOperation failed. Not connected. Failed operation: 253 PeerState: Disconnecting\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Error      -  [NetworkTransport] Failed to raise deferred operation of type 8.\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Error      -  [NetworkTransport] Failed to raise deferred operation of type 8.\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Debug      -  [Behaviour] No longer in room, cleaning up.\n\n[...]\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Debug      -  Removed player WubTheCaptain\n\n2026.08.31 18:36:17 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnDisconnected: ClientTimeout\n\n```\n\nSeems to have resolved itself again, after 5 disconnects.",
